WEBVTT

00:19:58.704 --> 00:20:01.204
It tells us that we want to eat the
chocolate cake in the fridge,

00:20:01.496 --> 00:20:03.913
that we should sell stock
when its value plummets,

00:20:04.288 --> 00:20:07.204
that we're angry when someone has
given us negative feedback,

00:20:07.996 --> 00:20:12.913
in contrast system to a slower, more
logical and more deliberative.

00:20:13.579 --> 00:20:16.038
It tells us we should wait
until after dinner to eat

00:20:16.038 --> 00:20:20.371
the chocolate cake to be patient. The
stock market can be volatile.

00:20:21.038 --> 00:20:25.038
That negative feedback is warranted.
Since you did make a few mistakes.

00:20:25.996 --> 00:20:30.038
The advice in business contexts is often
that we should learn to disregard